@startuml
note "State Machine Process Actor" as N1
state Created
state Ready
state BusyMaterialFlow
state BusyOperation
state Persisting


[*] --> Created
Created --> Ready: InitializeInlineActorCmd(InlineActorRecipients)
Ready --> BusyMaterialFlow: PushDownstreamCmd(Part)
BusyMaterialFlow --> Ready: MaterialflowResult()
Ready --> BusyOperation: StartOperationCmd()
BusyOperation --> Ready: CycleTime elapsed
Ready -> Persisting: ShutdownCmd
BusyOperation -> Persisting: ShutdownCmd
BusyMaterialFlow -down-> Persisting: ShutDownCmd
Persisting -> [*]: Done
@enduml